Package: rpbnb.tmb
Type: Package
Title: Random-Parameter Bivariate Negative Binomial Regression (TMB)
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Zhenyu", "Wang", email = "wonstran@hotmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maximum-simulated-likelihood estimation of a bivariate
    random-parameter negative binomial model with Famoye/Sarmanov or
    discrete-copula (Frank, Gaussian, or Clayton) dependence, using
    Template Model Builder (TMB) for automatic differentiation.
